    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to \u200b<strong>Rhythm Animal Caf\u00e9</strong>, hidden at the corner of the street! This is the central stage for the lives of all the animal residents in this small alley. Every single day, the animals living here perform their unique and busy \u201csymphony of beats.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/55afc3b5e77e04b8e74c0117b60494db.avif?t=1754637385\" data-has-big width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Super Simple Intuitive Operation\u3011\u200b</strong>\u200b</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the time, all you need to do is focus on the rhythm and tap with precise timing! The operation is extremely simplified, but the pursuit of perfect timing delivers endless satisfaction and unexpected bouts of laughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/578f7d249a347dc6f400b4a013730e27.poster.avif?t=1754637385\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/578f7d249a347dc6f400b4a013730e27.webm?t=1754637385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/578f7d249a347dc6f400b4a013730e27.mp4?t=1754637385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Collection of Quirky Animals\u3011\u200b</strong>\u200b</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Mr. Dog, the corporate working-dog; Panda Master, juggling multiple jobs; and the caf\u00e9\u2019s little snack thief cat... Everyday tasks based on each character\u2019s identity and profession have been meticulously designed into rhythm minigames that are both hilariously funny and heartwarmingly relatable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/b5c5739b9e1d43f7f64ad15c20b5c406.poster.avif?t=1754637385\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/b5c5739b9e1d43f7f64ad15c20b5c406.webm?t=1754637385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/b5c5739b9e1d43f7f64ad15c20b5c406.mp4?t=1754637385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Original Soundtrack Tailored to the Theme\u3011\u200b</strong>\u200b</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in original music brimming with the energy of daily life! Everyday sounds transform into melodies, providing you with diverse, catchy, warm, and slightly addictive background music that perfectly complements each character\u2019s \u201cbusy life.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/96df00f82a53ed34a602fbec051a0799.poster.avif?t=1754637385\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/96df00f82a53ed34a602fbec051a0799.webm?t=1754637385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/96df00f82a53ed34a602fbec051a0799.mp4?t=1754637385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Healing, Absurd Atmosphere\u3011\u200b</strong>\u200b</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when you make a mistake occasionally, watching the animals flail about or look innocently baffled will make you chuckle. In this sun-drenched corner of the \u200b<strong>Rhythm Animal Caf\u00e9</strong>, amidst the clatter of pots and pans filling the alley, feel that relaxed, humorous, wonderfully absurd, yet incredibly warm atmosphere of everyday existence.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to \u200b<strong>Rhythm Animal Caf\u00e9</strong>, hidden at the corner of the street! This is the central stage for the lives of all the animal residents in this small alley. Every single day, the animals living here perform their unique and busy \u201csymphony of beats.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/55afc3b5e77e04b8e74c0117b60494db.avif?t=1754637385\" data-has-big width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Super Simple Intuitive Operation\u3011\u200b</strong>\u200b</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most of the time, all you need to do is focus on the rhythm and tap with precise timing! The operation is extremely simplified, but the pursuit of perfect timing delivers endless satisfaction and unexpected bouts of laughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/578f7d249a347dc6f400b4a013730e27.poster.avif?t=1754637385\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/578f7d249a347dc6f400b4a013730e27.webm?t=1754637385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/578f7d249a347dc6f400b4a013730e27.mp4?t=1754637385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Collection of Quirky Animals\u3011\u200b</strong>\u200b</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Mr. Dog, the corporate working-dog; Panda Master, juggling multiple jobs; and the caf\u00e9\u2019s little snack thief cat... Everyday tasks based on each character\u2019s identity and profession have been meticulously designed into rhythm minigames that are both hilariously funny and heartwarmingly relatable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/b5c5739b9e1d43f7f64ad15c20b5c406.poster.avif?t=1754637385\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/b5c5739b9e1d43f7f64ad15c20b5c406.webm?t=1754637385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/b5c5739b9e1d43f7f64ad15c20b5c406.mp4?t=1754637385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Original Soundtrack Tailored to the Theme\u3011\u200b</strong>\u200b</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in original music brimming with the energy of daily life! Everyday sounds transform into melodies, providing you with diverse, catchy, warm, and slightly addictive background music that perfectly complements each character\u2019s \u201cbusy life.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/96df00f82a53ed34a602fbec051a0799.poster.avif?t=1754637385\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/96df00f82a53ed34a602fbec051a0799.webm?t=1754637385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859210/extras/96df00f82a53ed34a602fbec051a0799.mp4?t=1754637385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Healing, Absurd Atmosphere\u3011\u200b</strong>\u200b</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even when you make a mistake occasionally, watching the animals flail about or look innocently baffled will make you chuckle. In this sun-drenched corner of the \u200b<strong>Rhythm Animal Caf\u00e9</strong>, amidst the clatter of pots and pans filling the alley, feel that relaxed, humorous, wonderfully absurd, yet incredibly warm atmosphere of everyday existence.</p>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to \u200bRhythm Animal Caf\u00e9\u200b! Animals' daily chaos meets funky beats: boss hype, colleague woes, your slacking, unfair blame\u2014all become hilarious one-tap rhythm games! Simple controls, joyful groove. Feel music fuse with daily life\u2019s warmth!",
